    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as Faye and Rich\u2019s painful memories resurface, the two friends are ensnared in the distorted corridors of a decrepit subway station beneath a city still foreign to Faye. To find any path through, they need to decipher all that they have so desperately tried to forget.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Illustration and Reflection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and illustrate meaningful objects and people to decipher Faye\u2019s history.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/fa590e2cadf2d4a0deb1f67336d1d6b5.poster.avif?t=1753756451\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/fa590e2cadf2d4a0deb1f67336d1d6b5.webm?t=1753756451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/fa590e2cadf2d4a0deb1f67336d1d6b5.mp4?t=1753756451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Living Memories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore living memories of Faye and Rich\u2019s past as they manifest around the stations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/e49597bc58b68d27b5fbf98f2341f9a3.poster.avif?t=1753756451\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/e49597bc58b68d27b5fbf98f2341f9a3.webm?t=1753756451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/e49597bc58b68d27b5fbf98f2341f9a3.mp4?t=1753756451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choice and Change</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge a new relationship between Faye and Rich as they collide with their hidden traumas and recent frictions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/347c0cf005c50e675550a9b81971667e.poster.avif?t=1753756451\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/347c0cf005c50e675550a9b81971667e.webm?t=1753756451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/347c0cf005c50e675550a9b81971667e.mp4?t=1753756451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dissipation of Agency</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate Faye\u2019s anxieties as distance between her and Rich propagates greater dangers around the station.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/c7ae2799c7facf810e87226f95c9df22.poster.avif?t=1753756451\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/c7ae2799c7facf810e87226f95c9df22.webm?t=1753756451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/c7ae2799c7facf810e87226f95c9df22.mp4?t=1753756451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Close-up Clues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with objects and structures more intimately to decipher their connection to Faye\u2019s past, or the distortion of the station.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/22b08e63eed61416f5b9d1e81a980d52.poster.avif?t=1753756451\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/22b08e63eed61416f5b9d1e81a980d52.webm?t=1753756451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/22b08e63eed61416f5b9d1e81a980d52.mp4?t=1753756451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Face the past</i>\u2014it\u2019s the only way forward.</p>",
