53756451\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/22b08e63eed61416f5b9d1e81a980d52.webm?t=1753756451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980980/extras/22b08e63eed61416f5b9d1e81a980d52.mp4?t=1753756451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Face the past</i>\u2014it\u2019s the only way forward.</p>",
